on behalf of dubai cares i would like to  congratulate mr ranjitsen desale  on winning the global teacher prize  2020. ranjit is a dynamic teacher whose  work has transformed the lives of his  students in india  and whose story has inspired many around  the world  today we honor his determination  kindness  and service to the next generation he  truly embodies the  very finest principles of the teaching  profession  in the dark days of covet 19 it is  teachers like ranjit  who are giving hope to children and  young people  today teachers around the world are  working day and night  to make sure that children keep learning  even when they cannot  enter the classroom at dubai cares  we've been working towards providing  children and youth in developing  countries with access to quality  education  since our inception in 2007 and since  then  we have successfully launched education  programs reaching  over 20 million beneficiaries in 60  developing countries  the entire team at dubai cares knows the  fundamental difference  that teachers make that's why supporting  teachers professional  development is a key thematic within our  program's portfolio  while the covet 19 pandemic has left a  significant impact on education  it will take all of us working together  to keep education alive throughout this  pandemic  that is why it is so important to  recognize and celebrate teachers like  ranjit  whose dedication and commitment will  change the world to a better place  thank you ranjit thank you for your  passion thank you for your efforts  i am confident that your fellow teachers  and yourself  will achieve your ambition to give  refugee children  their best hope of recovering from this  global crisis
 

